===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|da|gmq-oda|ef}}, {{m|gmq-oda|em}},  {{m|gmq-oda|um}}, from {{inh|da|non|ef}}, from {{inh|da|gem-pro|*jabai||when, if}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|if}}, {{cog|de|ob||if}}.

